# Exploratory-testing session artifacts. They hold transcribed application
# output and arrive UNTRACKED, so a project gate that stages everything before
# committing would sweep them into a commit. Ignore before the first session —
# .gitignore is inert for a path git already tracks.
.exploratory/

# This plugin's own marker directory: the orchestrator activation marker, the
# boundary marker and its fired-record. All transient session state.
.stride-copilot-lite/
